    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Exporter queue size vs capacity",
      "description": "Per Collector and queue (one sending queue per exporter and signal): otelcol is the obs Collector the services send to (exporter otlp_grpc/lgtm), otelcol-contrib the Collector inside the lgtm container.",
